  "notes": "NO PRICES PUBLISHED: the Bellwood menu on the chain's own site is a 2-page PDF (a photo of the printed menu) whose price columns are blank, so every price is ''. Address match: the PDF cover reads '4019 Butterfield Road (at Mannheim), Bellwood, IL 60104'; it is what https://mrsubmarine.com/bellwood/menu (the 'View Menu' link on the Bellwood store page and in the chain's store locator) redirects to. AGE WARNING: the file is named '2018-Bellwood-Menu.pdf' and sits in a 2020/09 upload folder, so the item list may be several years old even though it is still the menu the site links to today; the hours printed on it already differ from the store page. Cold and hot subs come in Reg and King sizes, and the menu says subs include lettuce, tomato, onion, cheese and special sauce unless noted; salads include a roll and choice of dressing. 'Specials' is on the PDF's second page. Also on the menu, not listed here: Family & Party Mix Deals, Drinks, more cold subs (Roast Beef, Corned Beef, Pastrami), more hot-sub lines and more sides. Prices might be obtainable from the delivery link on the store page (https://mrsubmarine.com/bellwood/delivery, which redirects to an Uber Eats 'Mr. Submarine' store); that page was NOT opened or address-checked, and marketplace prices are usually marked up. 'Jalapeno Poppers' is printed 'Jalapeño Poppers'.",
